      "comment": "CREEPING TIGER (6) last start finished last on July 22 over 365m at Nowra behind Clattered beaten 4.5 lengths (21.24) in a Grade 5. Looks suited and should go close. DOLLAR ROLEX (1) goes very well here starting nine times for three wins and three minors. Was out of placings last time (22.90) at Gosford in a Grade 5, finishing seventh and beaten 8 lengths. Can feature with the right run. WADE'S EDGE (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (23.23) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to his name from nine starts. Warrants plenty of respect. JET FUEL (4) is in the mix after placing last time out.",
